{"format":"sylvinia-studio-ca","version":1,"module":"remerii-ambient","file":"chronique-alternative/source/src/remerii-ambient.ts","hash":"49c2c9a5f0c96859","label":"Remerii · moments libres","group":"Remerii","scenes":[{"key":"§REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","title":"","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-lecture","title":"La mauvaise fin","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-the","title":"Le fond de la tasse","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-erreur","title":"La caisse fendue","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-bijoux","title":"Le fermoir","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-medig","title":"Une place convoitée","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-ponctuation","title":"Un compliment douteux","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-parapluie","title":"La pluie de côté","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-sablier","title":"Le rendez-vous en retard","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-enigme","title":"Le livre hors d’atteinte","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-musique","title":"L’air qui reste","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-fatigue","title":"Le mot oublié","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-tendresse","title":"Une place près de la fenêtre","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-question-franche","title":"Un avis demandé","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-rature","title":"Une tache d’encre","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true},{"key":"remerii-cinq-minutes","title":"Le chemin le plus long","section":"REMERII_AMBIENT_LINES","used":true}],"items":[{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0b9hgjg","k":"s","text":"La mauvaise fin","sc":1,"line":12,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0pdytuq","k":"s","text":"Remerii referme un roman en gardant un doigt entre les dernières pages. « Il lui restait trois lignes pour ne pas gâcher son livre. Il les a employées toutes les trois. »","sc":1,"line":12,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0vgeuh1","k":"s","text":"Lui demander de raconter la fin, si cela peut soulager son indignation.","sc":1,"line":13,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s04bm90d","k":"s","text":"Vous risquez d’y perdre toute envie de le lire.","sc":1,"line":13,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s141cabw","k":"s","text":"Vous venez déjà d’y contribuer.","sc":1,"line":13,"sp":"{player}","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1oz6qtx","k":"s","text":"Elle vous résume la fin avec des gestes de plus en plus vifs, puis vous tend le livre.","sc":1,"line":13,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1m9twu3","k":"s","text":"Lisez le début. Il était excellent. C’est ce qui m’agace.","sc":1,"line":13,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n18n1j7y","k":"n","text":"3","sc":1,"line":13,"sp":"rem-read-ending","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s119ps4u","k":"s","text":"Préférer découvrir le livre avant de partager son jugement.","sc":1,"line":14,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0ao7ppl","k":"s","text":"Très bien. Je garderai mes objections jusqu’à votre retour.","sc":1,"line":14,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s001a1ol","k":"s","text":"Elle retire son marque-page et vous indique le comptoir de prêt.","sc":1,"line":14,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s07ufx9r","k":"s","text":"Ne sautez pas au dernier chapitre. Je veux savoir à quel moment vous commencerez à lui en vouloir.","sc":1,"line":14,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1m3dvsr","k":"n","text":"3","sc":1,"line":14,"sp":"rem-read-save","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0jl2r5i","k":"n","text":"1","sc":1,"line":14,"sp":"rem-read-save","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0eu36wx","k":"s","text":"Le fond de la tasse","sc":2,"line":16,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s150yv30","k":"s","text":"Remerii retient quelques feuilles de thé avec sa cuillère. « Le filtre est resté dans la cuisine. Je l’ai vu en passant et j’ai trouvé le moyen de ne pas le prendre. »","sc":2,"line":16,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s04bukyp","k":"s","text":"Aller demander un filtre ou une seconde tasse.","sc":2,"line":17,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s04goklm","k":"s","text":"Vous revenez avec une passoire. Elle la tient pendant que vous versez.","sc":2,"line":17,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s00ujtza","k":"s","text":"Merci. Je vous laisse les feuilles ; j’ai déjà assez mâché ce thé.","sc":2,"line":17,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s09kh3it","k":"s","text":"Elle rapproche ensuite le plat de biscuits pour que vous puissiez vous servir.","sc":2,"line":17,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n09wp4oy","k":"n","text":"3","sc":2,"line":17,"sp":"rem-tea-filter","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n13ldbon","k":"n","text":"1","sc":2,"line":17,"sp":"rem-tea-filter","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s02pmj69","k":"s","text":"Lui proposer d’attendre que les feuilles se déposent en discutant.","sc":2,"line":18,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0zxw29w","k":"s","text":"D’accord. Je m’interdirai simplement les gestes trop éloquents.","sc":2,"line":18,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1692uz6","k":"s","text":"Elle pose la tasse et vous demande ce que vous avez fait depuis votre dernière rencontre. Au bout d’un moment, vous lui rappelez qu’elle peut boire.","sc":2,"line":18,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0mf685d","k":"s","text":"Ah. Cette fois, il est froid.","sc":2,"line":18,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1snd8v6","k":"n","text":"3","sc":2,"line":18,"sp":"rem-tea-wait","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1shyyh7","k":"n","text":"1","sc":2,"line":18,"sp":"rem-tea-wait","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0kvlsvz","k":"s","text":"La caisse fendue","sc":3,"line":20,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0giaj5o","k":"s","text":"Une caisse de matériel bloque l’atelier. Remerii vous arrête avant que vous la saisissiez : « Le fond se détache. On vide d’abord. »","sc":3,"line":20,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0qlghjq","k":"s","text":"Déposer le contenu sur la table pendant qu’elle tient le fond.","sc":3,"line":21,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0qx3ioo","k":"s","text":"Vous sortez les instruments un à un. Remerii vous indique où poser les plus fragiles.","sc":3,"line":21,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0hsdr8e","k":"s","text":"Voilà. Maintenant, nous pouvons déplacer ce magnifique déchet.","sc":3,"line":21,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1qkv2hp","k":"s","text":"Elle vous aide à emporter les planches.","sc":3,"line":21,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0lsdm6a","k":"n","text":"3","sc":3,"line":21,"sp":"rem-crate-empty","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1lrznpm","k":"s","text":"Lui montrer l’étiquette « solide et durable » sur le côté.","sc":3,"line":22,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s19h0is6","k":"s","text":"Remerii lit, puis vous demande de garder l’étiquette.","sc":3,"line":22,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1hb27q1","k":"s","text":"Je vais la rapporter au vendeur. Seule. Ce sera plus facile à porter que le reste de sa promesse.","sc":3,"line":22,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0tlw90d","k":"s","text":"Vous videz ensemble la caisse avant de dégager la porte.","sc":3,"line":22,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1ykwe8i","k":"n","text":"3","sc":3,"line":22,"sp":"rem-crate-label","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1epjkxn","k":"n","text":"1","sc":3,"line":22,"sp":"rem-crate-label","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0hoop8f","k":"n","text":"1","sc":4,"line":27,"sp":"remerii-bijoux","role":"condition minStage"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0sh8yvg","k":"s","text":"Le fermoir","sc":4,"line":24,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0deuzfx","k":"s","text":"Remerii tient un bracelet ouvert. « Il ferme parfaitement sur la table. À mon poignet, il découvre soudain des convictions. »","sc":4,"line":24,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1bg6mmb","k":"s","text":"Lui proposer de tenir l’extrémité pendant qu’elle ferme le bracelet.","sc":4,"line":25,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1ykpsb5","k":"s","text":"Oui, merci. Ce côté-là.","sc":4,"line":25,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0xc3iua","k":"s","text":"Vous maintenez le bout de chaîne. Elle rabat le fermoir et vérifie qu’il tient.","sc":4,"line":25,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0sc3cik","k":"s","text":"Il me plaît trop pour que je lui en veuille longtemps.","sc":4,"line":25,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0ji2bnl","k":"n","text":"2","sc":4,"line":25,"sp":"rem-clasp-help","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0u46432","k":"n","text":"2","sc":4,"line":25,"sp":"rem-clasp-help","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0bj42a8","k":"s","text":"Lui demander pourquoi elle a choisi celui-ci.","sc":4,"line":26,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1gfrxto","k":"s","text":"La couleur, d’abord. Regardez quand on le tourne.","sc":4,"line":26,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0llehka","k":"s","text":"Elle vous montre le reflet, puis range le bracelet dans sa poche.","sc":4,"line":26,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1dljn6r","k":"s","text":"Je le ferai réparer. J’aimerais autant le garder jusqu’au bout de la journée.","sc":4,"line":26,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1yp2ovh","k":"n","text":"3","sc":4,"line":26,"sp":"rem-clasp-taste","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1as3tze","k":"s","text":"Une place convoitée","sc":5,"line":28,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0extqu2","k":"s","text":"Medig occupe le dossier du fauteuil de Remerii. Lorsque celle-ci approche, la chouette déploie une aile. « Elle a parfaitement compris. Elle négocie. »","sc":5,"line":28,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1o57rn9","k":"s","text":"Vous installer ailleurs et laisser Remerii régler le différend.","sc":5,"line":29,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0z1rbqn","k":"s","text":"Remerii présente son bras. Medig s’y pose après un temps considérable.","sc":5,"line":29,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0e63ore","k":"s","text":"Merci de votre diligence.","sc":5,"line":29,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s128mjtt","k":"s","text":"Elle s’assied enfin ; la chouette reprend aussitôt le dossier, juste derrière sa tête.","sc":5,"line":29,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n06l1qe5","k":"n","text":"3","sc":5,"line":29,"sp":"rem-medig-wait","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0w8mxts","k":"n","text":"1","sc":5,"line":29,"sp":"rem-medig-wait","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s17mfzfx","k":"s","text":"Proposer une troisième chaise pour que vous ayez tous une place.","sc":5,"line":30,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0hfi8ba","k":"s","text":"Elle choisira la vôtre. Je préfère vous prévenir.","sc":5,"line":30,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1iq3q2h","k":"s","text":"Vous apportez la chaise. Medig vous regarde, puis ferme les yeux.","sc":5,"line":30,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0r2umz3","k":"s","text":"Ou elle nous laissera déplacer les meubles pour son divertissement.","sc":5,"line":30,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n19laop0","k":"n","text":"3","sc":5,"line":30,"sp":"rem-medig-joke","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s15s113w","k":"s","text":"Un compliment douteux","sc":6,"line":32,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0siohzv","k":"s","text":"Remerii vous lit une phrase d’un courrier : « Votre intervention était moins désastreuse qu’on pouvait le craindre. » Elle relève les yeux. « J’hésite à remercier. »","sc":6,"line":32,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0frn5wz","k":"s","text":"Proposer : « Votre soulagement me touche. »","sc":6,"line":33,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1fl9crg","k":"s","text":"C’est assez court pour ne pas leur laisser de prise.","sc":6,"line":33,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1ndhc8b","k":"s","text":"Elle note la phrase, puis ajoute le nom du destinataire.","sc":6,"line":33,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0yahp0n","k":"s","text":"Je reconnaîtrai votre participation si l’on proteste.","sc":6,"line":33,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n06ve28b","k":"n","text":"3","sc":6,"line":33,"sp":"rem-letter-answer","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0l1ruia","k":"n","text":"1","sc":6,"line":33,"sp":"rem-letter-answer","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1w1wg6j","k":"s","text":"Suggérer de répondre uniquement aux renseignements utiles du courrier.","sc":6,"line":34,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s06gs37n","k":"s","text":"Elle relit la page.","sc":6,"line":34,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0bavkvg","k":"s","text":"Cela nous laisse deux lignes. Ils auraient pu économiser du papier.","sc":6,"line":34,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1key6mu","k":"s","text":"Elle rédige une réponse brève, sèche et parfaitement lisible.","sc":6,"line":34,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n14thwh9","k":"n","text":"3","sc":6,"line":34,"sp":"rem-letter-nothing","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0y4l9rx","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":39,"sp":"remerii-parapluie","role":"condition minStage"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1ijwr96","k":"s","text":"La pluie de côté","sc":7,"line":36,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1r17txe","k":"s","text":"Le vent rabat la pluie sous l’auvent. Remerii recule d’un pas et découvre que votre épaule est déjà trempée. « Nous avons choisi le mauvais bout. »","sc":7,"line":36,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0x6iieh","k":"s","text":"Lui montrer un renfoncement sec de l’autre côté de la porte.","sc":7,"line":37,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s02huahn","k":"s","text":"Vous vous y glissez ensemble. Elle secoue doucement sa manche vers la rue.","sc":7,"line":37,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0qk84zo","k":"s","text":"Beaucoup mieux. J’aurais dû vous écouter avant d’annoncer que l’averse passait.","sc":7,"line":37,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0w5y05i","k":"s","text":"Elle passe. Sur nous.","sc":7,"line":37,"sp":"{player}","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1j0kp3h","k":"s","text":"Elle rit et vous fait davantage de place.","sc":7,"line":37,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1e955za","k":"n","text":"3","sc":7,"line":37,"sp":"rem-rain-move","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1xtmqju","k":"n","text":"2","sc":7,"line":37,"sp":"rem-rain-move","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1chihvu","k":"s","text":"Ouvrir votre parapluie et lui proposer de partager le chemin.","sc":7,"line":38,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1d03ljy","k":"s","text":"Oui. Plus haut, sinon mon front arrive avant nous.","sc":7,"line":38,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s055mpwa","k":"s","text":"Vous relevez la poignée. Elle se rapproche et vous indique la rue la moins exposée au vent.","sc":7,"line":38,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0ei5rka","k":"s","text":"Je vous tiens le coude dans l’escalier. Il est glissant.","sc":7,"line":38,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0likoqw","k":"n","text":"3","sc":7,"line":38,"sp":"rem-rain-umbrella","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1o1t5qt","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":38,"sp":"rem-rain-umbrella","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0ddu5ku","k":"n","text":"1","sc":8,"line":43,"sp":"remerii-sablier","role":"condition minStage"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0fycjw3","k":"s","text":"Le rendez-vous en retard","sc":8,"line":40,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1f0lbq7","k":"s","text":"Remerii attend quelqu’un qui ne vient pas. Elle relit le billet. « Même son excuse est en retard. »","sc":8,"line":40,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0sorxqv","k":"s","text":"Lui tenir compagnie jusqu’à ce qu’elle décide de partir.","sc":8,"line":41,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1o8nito","k":"s","text":"Elle vous demande des nouvelles, puis glisse le billet dans sa poche lorsque la cloche sonne.","sc":8,"line":41,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s11rhhg9","k":"s","text":"C’est assez. Je vais déjeuner. Vous venez ?","sc":8,"line":41,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0i675me","k":"s","text":"Elle laisse son nom au comptoir, sans prolonger l’attente.","sc":8,"line":41,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1kcwwbv","k":"n","text":"3","sc":8,"line":41,"sp":"rem-late-company","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1hgj2vn","k":"n","text":"2","sc":8,"line":41,"sp":"rem-late-company","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s03v238r","k":"s","text":"L’aider à trouver de quoi laisser un mot.","sc":8,"line":42,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0joeg9i","k":"s","text":"Vous lui tendez un feuillet. Elle écrit où la personne pourra la retrouver plus tard.","sc":8,"line":42,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0ikfcls","k":"s","text":"Vous ne dites pas que vous êtes fâchée ?","sc":8,"line":42,"sp":"{player}","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0p2ya22","k":"s","text":"La brièveté suffira. Elle connaît mon écriture quand je suis aimable.","sc":8,"line":42,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n021cudq","k":"n","text":"2","sc":8,"line":42,"sp":"rem-late-note","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0g5qyht","k":"n","text":"2","sc":8,"line":42,"sp":"rem-late-note","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0eymy9j","k":"s","text":"Le livre hors d’atteinte","sc":9,"line":44,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0qkz8i2","k":"s","text":"Un ouvrage attend tout en haut d’une étagère. Remerii regarde l’escabeau occupé par trois pots. « Quelqu’un a confondu le rangement avec une vengeance. »","sc":9,"line":44,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0kbq6lu","k":"s","text":"Déplacer les pots pour libérer l’escabeau.","sc":9,"line":45,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0e2y38e","k":"s","text":"Vous posez les pots sur une table. Remerii monte chercher son livre, puis vous en tend un second.","sc":9,"line":45,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1pv4sqp","k":"s","text":"C’est celui que vous aviez demandé. Il se cachait derrière le mien.","sc":9,"line":45,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1bn3cep","k":"s","text":"Elle redescend avant de vous aider à ranger les pots ailleurs.","sc":9,"line":45,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n117gfsm","k":"n","text":"3","sc":9,"line":45,"sp":"rem-shelf-ladder","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0zux6sz","k":"n","text":"1","sc":9,"line":45,"sp":"rem-shelf-ladder","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0nhh94l","k":"s","text":"Aller chercher la personne qui range cette étagère.","sc":9,"line":46,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0wnyocv","k":"s","text":"Une aide revient avec un crochet prévu pour les ouvrages du dernier rang.","sc":9,"line":46,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0rkwkes","k":"s","text":"Ah. J’aurais aimé connaître son existence avant l’escabeau.","sc":9,"line":46,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1comv6g","k":"s","text":"Elle remercie l’aide et lui demande où replacer le crochet après usage.","sc":9,"line":46,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1y6qx35","k":"n","text":"3","sc":9,"line":46,"sp":"rem-shelf-ask","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1iq7u38","k":"n","text":"2","sc":10,"line":51,"sp":"remerii-musique","role":"condition minStage"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0yi00rm","k":"s","text":"L’air qui reste","sc":10,"line":48,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0m9ql55","k":"s","text":"Remerii fredonne quelques notes, puis s’arrête en vous voyant. « Je ne retrouve pas la suite. Ne me dites pas que vous l’avez entendu : cela ne m’aiderait que si vous la connaissez. »","sc":10,"line":48,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0r2xqql","k":"s","text":"Lui demander de reprendre le début pour essayer de reconnaître l’air.","sc":10,"line":49,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s174izmy","k":"s","text":"Elle recommence, plus bas. Vous ne reconnaissez rien et le lui dites.","sc":10,"line":49,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0rihxd6","k":"s","text":"Au moins, vous ne m’en avez pas inventé une autre.","sc":10,"line":49,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1kl6ufk","k":"s","text":"Elle sourit et abandonne pour l’instant, sans vous demander de chanter.","sc":10,"line":49,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n159tfj8","k":"n","text":"2","sc":10,"line":49,"sp":"rem-tune-listen","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1qm6j53","k":"n","text":"2","sc":10,"line":49,"sp":"rem-tune-listen","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0c1l794","k":"s","text":"Proposer une suite volontairement absurde en la chantonnant.","sc":10,"line":50,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0vhdq4c","k":"s","text":"Elle vous écoute jusqu’au bout avec les sourcils levés.","sc":10,"line":50,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0ja2ggq","k":"s","text":"Maintenant, c’est celle-ci que je vais garder dans la tête. Vous me le paierez.","sc":10,"line":50,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1o94tg5","k":"s","text":"Quelques pas plus loin, elle reprend malgré elle vos dernières notes.","sc":10,"line":50,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0ux6l1h","k":"n","text":"3","sc":10,"line":50,"sp":"rem-tune-improvise","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0kv8zmm","k":"n","text":"2","sc":11,"line":55,"sp":"remerii-fatigue","role":"condition minStage"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0sk46r6","k":"s","text":"Le mot oublié","sc":11,"line":52,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1vssvfp","k":"s","text":"Remerii s’arrête au milieu d’une phrase. « Le petit objet avec lequel on… Je le connais. Ne souriez pas. »","sc":11,"line":52,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1u9xg87","k":"s","text":"Lui demander de décrire l’objet.","sc":11,"line":53,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1t6gnnp","k":"s","text":"On s’en sert pour retirer les agrafes des dossiers.","sc":11,"line":53,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1ef473c","k":"s","text":"Un ôte-agrafes ?","sc":11,"line":53,"sp":"{player}","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1yacgr4","k":"s","text":"Elle ferme les yeux une seconde.","sc":11,"line":53,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s130h8q0","k":"s","text":"Je vous remercie. Oubliez le temps qu’il m’a fallu.","sc":11,"line":53,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n15ne7xq","k":"n","text":"3","sc":11,"line":53,"sp":"rem-word-help","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s07zfqom","k":"s","text":"Lui laisser le temps de retrouver le mot.","sc":11,"line":54,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0gspiib","k":"s","text":"Vous reprenez la page qu’elle vous montrait. Le mot lui revient quelques instants plus tard, à voix beaucoup trop haute.","sc":11,"line":54,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1ysvyac","k":"s","text":"Pardon. Il avait pris toute la place.","sc":11,"line":54,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1pmpzw9","k":"s","text":"Elle achève enfin sa phrase.","sc":11,"line":54,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0zndbof","k":"n","text":"3","sc":11,"line":54,"sp":"rem-word-wait","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0ais3nt","k":"n","text":"3","sc":12,"line":59,"sp":"remerii-tendresse","role":"condition minStage"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1i0e951","k":"s","text":"Une place près de la fenêtre","sc":12,"line":56,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0sufjfe","k":"s","text":"Remerii retire son sac d’une chaise lorsque vous approchez. « Je l’ai gardée. On y voit mieux que près de la porte. »","sc":12,"line":56,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0ryofs2","k":"s","text":"Vous asseoir et la remercier d’avoir pensé à vous.","sc":12,"line":57,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1nwkvbz","k":"s","text":"Vous vous plaignez de la pénombre à chaque fois. J’ai fini par m’en souvenir.","sc":12,"line":57,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1tmzun6","k":"s","text":"Elle pousse la lampe vers le milieu de la table et reprend sa conversation avec vous.","sc":12,"line":57,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n14zonvv","k":"n","text":"3","sc":12,"line":57,"sp":"rem-seat-thanks","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1k79hdr","k":"n","text":"2","sc":12,"line":57,"sp":"rem-seat-thanks","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s17pqcis","k":"s","text":"Lui proposer de garder une place à votre tour lors de votre prochaine rencontre.","sc":12,"line":58,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s03oh0yc","k":"s","text":"Une chaise qui ne boite pas. Je ne suis pas excessivement exigeante.","sc":12,"line":58,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1hzhag3","k":"s","text":"Elle vous observe sourire.","sc":12,"line":58,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1r0lc3d","k":"s","text":"Pour une chaise, du moins.","sc":12,"line":58,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1u8i1yl","k":"n","text":"3","sc":12,"line":58,"sp":"rem-seat-reciprocity","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0m6sa4c","k":"n","text":"1","sc":12,"line":58,"sp":"rem-seat-reciprocity","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1u9f2t9","k":"n","text":"2","sc":13,"line":63,"sp":"remerii-question-franche","role":"condition minStage"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1e1b72z","k":"s","text":"Un avis demandé","sc":13,"line":60,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1qn0xqr","k":"s","text":"Remerii hésite entre deux foulards. « Lequel ? Si vous répondez “les deux”, je vous renvoie au comptoir. »","sc":13,"line":60,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s125i4qb","k":"s","text":"Choisir le bleu et lui dire ce qui vous plaît dans cette couleur.","sc":13,"line":61,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s123q3ba","k":"s","text":"Elle le pose sur son épaule et regarde le reflet dans la vitre.","sc":13,"line":61,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0n6vf5z","k":"s","text":"Oui. Je pense aussi.","sc":13,"line":61,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0l5jmbk","k":"s","text":"Elle paie son achat sans vous faire deviner une autre réponse.","sc":13,"line":61,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n10046fq","k":"n","text":"3","sc":13,"line":61,"sp":"rem-scarf-blue","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1cesm9s","k":"s","text":"Préférer l’autre, même si elle semblait attirée par le bleu.","sc":13,"line":62,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1x757ll","k":"s","text":"Vraiment ? Montrez.","sc":13,"line":62,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1osete5","k":"s","text":"Vous lui tendez le foulard. Elle l’essaie, hésite, puis reprend le bleu.","sc":13,"line":62,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1kfsn6i","k":"s","text":"Je garde mon premier choix. Merci d’avoir répondu franchement.","sc":13,"line":62,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1gc2frz","k":"n","text":"3","sc":13,"line":62,"sp":"rem-scarf-other","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n01a4m0i","k":"n","text":"1","sc":13,"line":62,"sp":"rem-scarf-other","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0yc92bf","k":"n","text":"1","sc":14,"line":67,"sp":"remerii-rature","role":"condition minStage"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1b9x8d6","k":"s","text":"Une tache d’encre","sc":14,"line":64,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1bybi44","k":"s","text":"Une tache traverse l’adresse que Remerii vient d’écrire. Elle retourne le papier : « Il me reste un côté pour prétendre que je sais tenir une plume. »","sc":14,"line":64,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1sh0sv5","k":"s","text":"Lui tendre une feuille propre.","sc":14,"line":65,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0i80fw3","k":"s","text":"Merci. Gardez celle-ci pour les brouillons.","sc":14,"line":65,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1v5z97q","k":"s","text":"Elle recopie lentement l’adresse, puis vous rend la plume essuyée.","sc":14,"line":65,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1v6ktkz","k":"s","text":"Cette version devrait au moins arriver chez la bonne personne.","sc":14,"line":65,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1ja6vhi","k":"n","text":"3","sc":14,"line":65,"sp":"rem-ink-paper","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s034sf2z","k":"s","text":"Lui demander si la tache fait partie de sa signature.","sc":14,"line":66,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1bkhyct","k":"s","text":"Uniquement pour mes correspondants les plus estimés. Elle m’a demandé des années d’entraînement.","sc":14,"line":66,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s11tbyaa","k":"s","text":"Elle vous tend le papier avant de rire de son propre sérieux.","sc":14,"line":66,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1ua2vel","k":"s","text":"Allez, donnez-moi plutôt quelque chose pour essuyer cela.","sc":14,"line":66,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n18272em","k":"n","text":"3","sc":14,"line":66,"sp":"rem-ink-joke","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1i82g06","k":"n","text":"4","sc":15,"line":71,"sp":"remerii-cinq-minutes","role":"condition minStage"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1eb9gcx","k":"s","text":"Le chemin le plus long","sc":15,"line":68,"role":"title"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s17tl8ir","k":"s","text":"Au croisement, Remerii vous indique deux rues. « Celle-ci est plus courte. L’autre nous laisse encore un peu de chemin ensemble. »","sc":15,"line":68,"role":"prompt"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1envkdb","k":"s","text":"Choisir la promenade la plus longue.","sc":15,"line":69,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0sdp95y","k":"s","text":"Elle se met en marche à côté de vous, sans presser le pas.","sc":15,"line":69,"sp":"Narration","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s00hbgth","k":"s","text":"Vous ne m’avez pas encore raconté la fin.","sc":15,"line":69,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1h3cyxd","k":"s","text":"De quoi ?","sc":15,"line":69,"sp":"{player}","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s1lrl4hc","k":"s","text":"Choisissez. Nous avons une rue entière.","sc":15,"line":69,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n1nvbkgb","k":"n","text":"4","sc":15,"line":69,"sp":"rem-way-long","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:n0e3l85f","k":"n","text":"1","sc":15,"line":69,"sp":"rem-way-long","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0wcgo38","k":"s","text":"Prendre la rue courte et proposer de la revoir bientôt.","sc":15,"line":70,"role":"choix"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0x7hy7o","k":"s","text":"D’accord. Écrivez-moi quand vous saurez.","sc":15,"line":70,"sp":"Remerii","role":"text"},{"id":"remerii-ambient:s0a0uulq","k":"s","text":"Elle vous accompagne jusqu’à votre embranchement et attend que vous ayez trouvé v